# CERTIFY-NEXT: Proved obligations: tri_nonneg (dependencies not checked in replay) [backend=lean]
# CERTIFY-NEXT: Proved obligations: down.decreases (dependencies not checked in replay) [backend=lean]
# CERTIFY-NEXT: Proved obligations: down_zero (dependencies not checked in replay) [backend=lean]
# CERTIFY-NEXT: Proved obligations: inc (dependencies not checked in replay) [backend=lean]

